@HostAddress = http://localhost:5050


### 1. Crear DisbursementOrder exitoso (201 Created)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/disbursement-orders
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: en-US

{
  "orderTrackingCode": "11111111-2222-3333-4444-555555555555",
  "affiliateStoreId": "aaaaaaaa-bbbb-cccc-dddd-eeeeeeeeeeee",
  "scheduledFrom": "2026-11-20",
  "scheduledTo": "2026-11-25",
  "transferCapAmount": 1500.50,
  "transferCapCurrencyCode": "PEN",
  "user": "operador_openpay01",
  "remarks": "Liquidacion semanal comercio afiliado Lima"
}

### 2. Probar duplicado de OrderTrackingCode en Español (409 Conflict)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/disbursement-orders
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: es-PE

{
  "orderTrackingCode": "11111111-2222-3333-4444-555555555555",
  "affiliateStoreId": "aaaaaaaa-bbbb-cccc-dddd-eeeeeeeeeeee",
  "scheduledFrom": "2026-11-20",
  "scheduledTo": "2026-11-25",
  "transferCapAmount": 1500.50,
  "transferCapCurrencyCode": "PEN",
  "user": "operador_openpay01"
}

### 3. Probar error de regla de negocio ScheduledTo <= ScheduledFrom (400 Bad Request)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/disbursement-orders
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: es-PE

{
  "orderTrackingCode": "99999999-2222-3333-4444-555555555555",
  "affiliateStoreId": "aaaaaaaa-bbbb-cccc-dddd-eeeeeeeeeeee",
  "scheduledFrom": "2026-11-25",
  "scheduledTo": "2026-11-20",
  "transferCapAmount": 1500.50,
  "transferCapCurrencyCode": "PEN",
  "user": "operador_openpay01"
}